# Change the working directory in: <tt> repos\ee\trunk\ee\testcase </tt> Then edit and execute: <tt> . ./s12_startup_scripts </tt> to configure the environment. The environment variables to be set are: ERIKA_FILES pointing to the Erika main folder (the folder downloaded with the svn checkout, it contains the testcase folder).
# Start the compilation with: 
